OL,3,GNEWSA'It's very overcrowded': Freed
OL,4,Aprisoners speak to BBC as new early
OL,5,Arelease scheme begins
OL,6,
OL,7,FVictims are questioning how they will
OL,8,Fbe protected. One woman, whose
OL,9,Fex-partner was convicted of coercive
OL,10,Fbehaviour and is due for early release,
OL,11,Fsays she's "fearing for her life"
OL,13,FOne probation officer, who will be
OL,14,Fresponsible for monitoring some of the
OL,15,Fearly releases, says managing the
OL,16,Finflux of offenders is "just too much"
OL,18,FA prison governor says the scheme is
OL,19,F"much needed relief" from the pressure
OL,20,Fof overcrowded prisons but cautions it
OL,21,Fwon't "solve the overarching problem"
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
